          "content": "Where it lives: Welcome and Name (140 pt, Hello), Building plan (120 pt), Home beside the current node (88 pt), quiz feedback sheet (56 pt crop), Lesson complete (160 pt, Celebrating), Companion (180 pt). Never in Lesson reading or the Bible reader: scripture stays quiet.",
